        "text": "the city is a stage for him",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C59B30B1A2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 56,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "people are immersed in his world",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4D6784DE4C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "Thirty years ago, my colleague François Delarozière, a designer, art performer, founded La Machine company.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1C7D1B5482",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "His aim to create large theater experiences in cities.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BE794A6C44",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 4,
        "text": "How?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "24A2C48AE7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "With huge animated machines.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0429EF27EE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "Since then, François' extraordinary machines appeared in streets, boulevards, avenues all over the world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7AF9AFD3B4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "These machines have no practical function at all.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1148CA08B7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 120,
        "endOffset": 137,
        "text": "new common ground",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8E229CF467",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 138,
        "text": "They tell stories for cities and their citizens, and they bring all communities together to create perhaps a new common ground.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "17F5990324",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "In 2016, the French port of Calais commissioned us a permanent art project.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D80375A3A7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "Two years later, the sea dragon appeared on the beach.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DBAD928FB9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "giant red wings",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ADE6D005FB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 33,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "long blue tail",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "074DDF9E6F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "He has two giant red wings and a long blue tail.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2DD2B1774B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "And he started his delightful promenades around the historic streets of Calais.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "65118B846E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 13,
        "text": "Spitting fire",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
