    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 26,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "new image",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "28C1A916BD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "The sea dragon is now the new image of the city.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9165872D7D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 8,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "I could say that he belongs to the city and is loved by everyone.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "055238DD43",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "37F3552145",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "La Machine is based in Nantes, a French city on the Atlantic coast of France.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A3FB2C90D6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 157,
        "text": "And our workshop is in a former shipyard where we now build the great elephant, the giant spider, the dragon horse, the Minotaur, the sea dragon, and others.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "93A87FFF25",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 7,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "permanent beehive",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "04499B2700",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "It's a permanent beehive with over 100 different trades and crafts involved.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B83D598FA9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "In our staff we have welders, musicians, mechanics, comedians, sculptors, engineers, roboticists and so on.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "319F947CD9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "Perhaps you would like to know how we make it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C69B514929",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 14,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "dragon-horse",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "17AE24D4DB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "Perhaps it's my favorite machine.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B264D0105E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "Long Ma was commissioned by Beijing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "50036FD7F6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "And then, with this machine, we performed in several cities in the world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "680E150A0B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 35,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "giant spider",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CA04CF1432",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "(Laughs) Big deal with the church.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C5F1ADAAAE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "(Laughter) Ottawa, the administrative capital of Canada, had a slogan at that time: \"Ottawa is not boring.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "39BFEC1A04",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "Of course not. 700,000 people came to see Long Ma and discovered the giant spider.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9E842A5996",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "And my God, they loved it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E2B79C826",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "These shows are free.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F1C64B60A8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "No tickets, no fences.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CD59CE9B80",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "It makes the city creative and inclusive.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6519954C3F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 26,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "giant moving machine",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9C2E4047DB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "La Machine is not only about street performances.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BB24481A8C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "We also develop large-scale spaces for ongoing moving exhibitions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4DDEAB9927",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "In Nantes, our home city, we created Les Machines de l’Île.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D1C3C1FECB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 166,
        "text": "Les Machines de l’Île is a cultural facility to support the urban regeneration program of the city, to make Nantes more attractive, both for inhabitants and visitors.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "456906593F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 225,
        "text": "The cultural facility includes the great elephant, who is working every day on the old dock esplanade, and next to it, the Carousel of the Sea World, with a living testimony to Jules Verne, who was born and grew up in Nantes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "61D576D4EC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "Why are these machines so special?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1DDD7422F8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "La Machine are movement.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AE6491F2EE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "La Machine are not just art, not just entertainment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0C1CA7A4E6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "They tell stories, but also they bring motion and emotions together in every person from spaces and times.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C12CE5E990",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "Our machines are poetic figures, and poetry has no business plan.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0E0DAD41BF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 131,
        "text": "But even if our shows are free, they generate great benefits for shops, cafes, restaurants and huge free media coverage for cities.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "085D2BD2D8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "In Liverpool, one day, a giant spider appeared magically on a building in front of the main train station.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "846999F903",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "Hundreds of thousands of people discovered the new face of Liverpool, and this image went around the world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E9BCC61766",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "Some cities with the machine wish to improve their image, like Ottawa, Calais or Liverpool.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0C8802CD71",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "Others choose urban planning issues.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "016A419039",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "Like Nantes or Toulouse.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E4C72E7B10",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "74",
        "end": "74",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "Toulouse is in the south of France, and we presented to the mayor of Toulouse in 2013 the Minotaur.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1857468DE2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 32,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "like Seattle is the home for Boeing",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C5848D7A5B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "Toulouse is the home of Airbus, like Seattle is the home for Boeing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0D817D7E68",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "And we presented to the leader of aeronautics in Europe an old and antique figure.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E3428AC3CC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 6,
        "text": "Crazy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5910796CD5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 91,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "like a labyrinth",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C90B120844",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "Toulouse is an ancient city where myths and stories of bulls are central, and this city is like a labyrinth.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F2FEF00BEA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "79",
        "end": "79",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "The Minotaur makes the link between the past and the future.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B5278C5996",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "80",
        "end": "80",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 117,
        "text": "Last October, we created a new character, the Guardian of Darkness, for the second part of the gigantic street opera.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9B947BB461",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "81",
        "end": "81",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "The Guardian of Darkness is both a woman and a scorpion, and she is the alter ego of the Minotaur.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F63BFC063",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "82",
        "end": "82",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "(Music) (Music ends) 1.2 million people over three days, so proud of their city.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ECA81137D1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "83",
        "end": "83",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "Last night, I had a thought -- Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "06B9A0B66D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "84",
        "end": "84",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "Last night I had a thought.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "646E84BB0F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "85",
        "end": "85",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 126,
        "text": "In La Machine, we don't really use artificial intelligence, but we definitely use artistic intelligence to reimagine humanity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "642904501A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "86",
        "end": "86",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F20D7E1706",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "87",
        "end": "87",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8280A88E0C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "First a drawing, then a model.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FB3561D732",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "The model is scanned to generate a digital wireframe.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "476BDC06B3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 165,
        "text": "Then we [make] wooden shells for the skin of the animal, a metal structure for the skeleton, including hydraulic and electrical systems to bring the machine to life.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B0FE4324B8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "Then the construction can begin.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9910C88BE0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "The carpenters lead the way, and other trades follow on.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DE137B0151",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "It takes around two years from the design to the completion.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "092D4AF0CB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "And then we are ready to operate a machine.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E32FF37DEB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "An average of 18 operators \"drive\" the machine with joystick and exoskeletons.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A5BFD79FF2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "One person per arm and per legs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "18F7BC6348",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "One operator for the head.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6E5C616281",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 172,
        "text": "Another one for the neck, one person for the wings, one person for special effects, one person for the tail, one pilot for the truck, one guide and a director of operation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BC3B46D637",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "He is the soul of the machine.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1AF48046F0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "He gives technical but also emotional indications.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0501F4518D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "All operators are connected to him with mics to make a realistic movement.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B0E732948B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 8,
        "text": "Long Ma.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0416D66F5B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}